In `contracts/stream-nft/src/lib.rs:82` (`NftDataKey::Allowance(Address)`), operator approvals are keyed solely by `spender: Address` rather than `(owner, spender)`, and `StreamNft::transfer_internal` (`lib.rs:526-557`) updates `NftDataKey::Owner` without clearing or epoch-invalidating prior approvals. Consequently, after holder `Alice` approves `spender` and transfers the StreamNft directly to `Bob`, `StreamNft::allowance(env, bob, spender)` (`lib.rs:252-268`) returns `1`, permitting `spender` to invoke `transfer_from` or `burn_from` against `Bob` without `Bob`'s consent.

